stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_validate: generation = req.body.generation
    q_validate --> q_400: !generation
    q_validate --> q_check_exists: generation provided
    q_400 --> [*]: res.status(400)
    q_check_exists --> q_409: existingRole found in DB
    q_check_exists --> q_create_role: no existing role
    q_409 --> [*]: res.status(409) "already exists"
    q_create_role --> q_500_discord: createRole(roleName) returns null
    q_create_role --> q_insert_db: role created on Discord
    q_500_discord --> [*]: res.status(500) "Failed to create role"
    q_insert_db --> q_500_db: insert error
    q_insert_db --> q_respond: insert success
    q_500_db --> [*]: res.status(500) "Failed to save to database"
    q_respond --> [*]: res.json(success, role_id, generation)

    note right of q_create_role
        INV-001: Generation uniqueness enforced by DB check before creation
        INV-002: Discord role created before DB insert (no rollback on DB failure)
        INV-003: generation value not validated for type/range
    end note
